-- A TYPICALLY that is an expression is worked out wherever it is taken: a
-- section input's, a rule input's and a record field's (W7). What it names has
-- to be in the module's own scope.

-- ERROR: a rule's default is worked out where the module's definitions are,
-- which does not include the rule's own other inputs
GIVEN base IS A NUMBER
      rate IS A NUMBER TYPICALLY (base PLUS 1)
GIVETH A NUMBER
scaled MEANS base TIMES rate

-- ERROR: nothing by that name
DECLARE Config HAS
  timeout IS A NUMBER TYPICALLY (nosuchname PLUS 1)
